### 1. user aanmaken (mag zonder token)
POST http://localhost:3030/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "jan@test.be", "password": "jan123"}

### 2. inloggen -> token bewaren
POST http://localhost:3030/authentication
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "local", "email": "jan@test.be", "password": "jan123"}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 3. zonder token -> 401 Not authenticated
GET http://localhost:3030/films

### 4. film toevoegen (route 1: POST) -> filmId bewaren
POST http://localhost:3030/films
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titel": "Inception", "jaar": 2010, "score": 9}

> {%
    client.global.set("filmId", response.body._id);
%}

### 5. foute film -> 400 validation failed
POST http://localhost:3030/films
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titel": "X", "jaar": 1800, "score": 11}

### 6. al mijn films (route 2: GET)
GET http://localhost:3030/films
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. een film (route 3: GET met id)
GET http://localhost:3030/films/{{filmId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. score aanpassen (route 4: PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3030/films/{{filmId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score": 8}

### 9. film verwijderen (route 5: DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3030/films/{{filmId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
